{
  "version": "1",
  "purpose": "Cross-repo seam conformance vectors (RR-0037 O1). Both sides — nested SeamProducer (reference brain) and OS LocalGovernanceDecisionClient (reference client) — MUST agree on the TIGHTEN-CLASS of every case: ALLOW->act, VERIFY_MORE/ESCALATE->approval, DENY->block; plus chosen_action equality on 'act'. Class-level (not verdict-label) parity is the contract: TrustedLoop treats VERIFY_MORE and ESCALATE identically (force approval). Editing this file requires updating the pinned sha256 in BOTH repos' conformance tests — a conscious cross-repo sync, by design.",
  "contract_version": "1.1.0",
